          "h": 236,
          "sprite": "envscan_good_dead",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 420,
          "y": 480,
          "w": 196,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "Dead (-40¢)",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "失效 (-40¢)",
            "zh": "失效 (-40¢)"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 526,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 130,
          "text": "Working: the waveform is steady and the lamp is solid green.\n\nOffset: the waveform drifts and the lamp is yellow.\n\nDead: the waveform no longer holds and the lamp is red.\n\nThe sensor is the one part that cannot be fixed with a screwdriver, tape or WD40.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "正常：波形稳定，指示灯常绿。\n\n偏移：波形偏移，指示灯为黄色。\n\n失效：波形失去控制，指示灯为红色。\n\n传感器是唯一无法使用螺丝刀、胶带和 WD40 修复的部件。",
            "zh": "正常：波形稳定，指示灯常绿。\n\n偏移：波形偏移，指示灯为黄色。\n\n失效：波形失去控制，指示灯为红色。\n\n传感器是唯一无法使用螺丝刀、胶带和 WD40 修复的部件。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        }
      ]
    },
