          "y": 480,
          "w": 196,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "Broken (-20¢)",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "破损 (-20¢)",
            "zh": "破损 (-20¢)"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 526,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 130,
          "text": "Good: the seam is tight and the surface is clean and intact.\n\nWorn: the surface is scratched and the coating is flaking.\n\nBroken: the screen is damaged, buttons are missing and the coating has flaked away.\n\nLight wear does not affect use, but heavy damage pulls the price down.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "良好：接缝紧密，表面完好洁净。\n\n磨损：表面有划痕，表面涂层存在剥落现象。\n\n破损：屏幕损坏，按钮缺失，表面涂层剥落严重。\n\n机身的轻微磨损不会影响使用，但严重的损坏会导致价值下跌。",
            "zh": "良好：接缝紧密，表面完好洁净。\n\n磨损：表面有划痕，表面涂层存在剥落现象。\n\n破损：屏幕损坏，按钮缺失，表面涂层剥落严重。\n\n机身的轻微磨损不会影响使用，但严重的损坏会导致价值下跌。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
